      "cooked": "<p>(Alternate thread title:&nbsp; Even Dead, Ex-Patriette Never Runs Out Of Bullets.)</p><p>It's possible that the RC/IR reprint is about to render this question moot, but for now at least I still need to know.&nbsp; Expat's third incap ability reads \"Select a hero.&nbsp; The next time that hero uses a power, that power also deals 1 projectile damage to 1 target\".&nbsp; I seem to recall reading somewhere around here that Wraith's \"Stealth\" power keeps stacking as long as it goes unused - if she Stealths, takes no damage, and Stealths again, then gets hit with damage, that damage will be reduced by 4.&nbsp; Does this Expat ability also stack?&nbsp; Can a hero sit there not using powers for several turns, but collecting a large number of 1-damage shots, which all go off at once whenever they finally do?&nbsp; (I'm assuming that they remain discrete 1-damage increments and don't combine to overcome DR, but by the same token, they would multiply bonuses...if you've also got a dead Young Legacy in the party, that could make for one apocalyptic power use, after many, many turns of doing nothing other than drawing cards.&nbsp; And with Nightmist in particular, doing nothing other than drawing cards is an immensely viable strategy, even if she doesn't have Mist Form or The Amulet in play.)</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:39:40.185Z",
